{"id":"18018df5c235cd7a","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbswitchclasses.md","title":"实值函数的切换、unate与unimodular类","display":"df-pbswitchclasses — 实值函数的切换、unate与unimodular类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbswitchclasses","aliases":["27-df-pbswitchclasses"],"display":"df-pbswitchclasses — 实值函数的切换、unate与unimodular类","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbalmostpositive]]","[[27-df-pbpolar]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.4, Definitions 13.14 and 13.16","source_printed_pages":"604","source_pdf_pages":"628","verification_status":"source-definition-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbswitchclasses"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbswitchclasses</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbswitchclasses — 实值函数的切换、unate与unimodular类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b4cf3e38d764f1d6\" href=\"?note=b4cf3e38d764f1d6\" title=\"27-df-pbalmostpositive\">27-df-pbalmostpositive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ec9751f6536e0aa8\" href=\"?note=ec9751f6536e0aa8\" title=\"27-df-pbpolar\">27-df-pbpolar</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.4, Definitions 13.14 and 13.16"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"604"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"628"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4cf3e38d764f1d6\" href=\"?note=b4cf3e38d764f1d6\" title=\"27-df-pbalmostpositive\">27-df-pbalmostpositive</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ec9751f6536e0aa8\" href=\"?note=ec9751f6536e0aa8\" title=\"27-df-pbpolar\">27-df-pbpolar</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_S:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^n,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\quad(\\sigma_S(x))_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1-x_i&amp;i\\in S,\\\\x_i&amp;i\\notin S.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma_S:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^n,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\quad(\\sigma_S(x))_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1-x_i&amp;i\\in S,\\\\x_i&amp;i\\notin S.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\coloneqq f\\circ\\sigma_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\coloneqq f\\circ\\sigma_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\in\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\in\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用原书这一节的unate命名，不能将它改写为Boolean式的坐标单调。切换S即补掉S中的坐标；图像原PDF补号已核对。σ_S为对合，故“某切换落入该类”与“由该类切换得到”等价。没有把可切换的存在性直接当成已经执行的识别算法。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbalmostpositive","status":"resolved","id":"b4cf3e38d764f1d6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbalmostpositive]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbpolar","status":"resolved","id":"ec9751f6536e0aa8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpolar]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbalmostpositive","status":"resolved","id":"b4cf3e38d764f1d6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$。$\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbalmostpositive]]，$\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbpolar]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbpolar","status":"resolved","id":"ec9751f6536e0aa8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$。$\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbalmostpositive]]，$\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbpolar]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_S:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}^n,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;\\forall i\\in[n]\\quad(\\sigma_S(x))_i\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1-x_i&i\\in S,\\\\x_i&i\\notin S.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\coloneqq f\\circ\\sigma_S.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBUnate}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\in\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBUnimodular}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n:\\exists S\\subseteq[n]\\;(\\mathrm{PBSwitch}(f,S)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1751,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbswitchclasses|df-pbswitchclasses — 实值函数的切换、unate与unimodular类]]"},{"id":"2896ab0b2ebccfa4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；各类与切换见 [[27-df-pbswitchclasses]]，$\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n$ 见 [[27-df-submodular]]，$J_i$ 见 [[27-df-pbderivative]]。"}],"outgoing":["b4cf3e38d764f1d6","ec9751f6536e0aa8"]}